{
    "title": "BLK Dating: Meet Black Singles",
    "description": "BLK is a dating and lifestyle app for culture makers in the Black community. Our mission is simple: To create a warm, inviting, supportive, and inclusive space where Black love is celebrated and respected in all its forms. \u2705 We want you to feel safe here, like you\u2019re at home. We\u2019re family, and around fam, you are able to express yourself\u2026 your full self! \ud83d\udcaf\r\n\r\nBlack is beautiful.  BLK is a platform where Blackness is celebrated \ud83d\ude4c\ud83c\udffe, Black people are seen \ud83d\udc40, and Black voices are amplified \ud83d\udce3.  Black Excellence is rooted in Black Love. \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffe Love for self. \ud83e\udd0e Love for others. \ud83e\udd0e And love for community.\ud83e\udd0e \r\n\r\nRated one of the 15 Best Online Dating Apps to Find Relationships by Oprah Daily. \ud83c\udfc6\r\nRated one of the 10 Best Black Dating Sites to Meet Black Singles in 2022 by SF Gate \ud83c\udfc6\r\nRated The Best Dating App for Black Women by 21Ninety \ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\nWe are more than just an online dating app.  We are an online community.  BLK is a lifestyle. \ud83d\ude0e Make meaningful connections on all levels.  Find love.  Find friends.  Find your match.  Find your squad.\r\n\r\n\u2022 \u201cBLK APP is more than just a place to connect with Black singles; it\u2019s creating a community for change\u201d \u2013 The Grio\r\n\u2022 \u201cThe Dating App Prioritizing Black Love Year-Round\u201d - PAPER\r\n\u2022 \u201cBLK sets out to reclaim \u2018Once You Go BLK\u2019 and celebrates the unlimited potential of Black Love\u201d \u2013 Purposely Awakened\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udda4 BLK is an easy and fun dating and lifestyle app to find new friends and romance:\r\n\u2022 First, set up a free profile and set your connection preferences.\r\n\u2022 Next, easily scroll through a personalized list of profiles. \ud83d\udcf1\r\n\u2022 If you like what you see, slide the profile to the \ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffe right to let them know you\u2019re feeling their profile.\r\n\u2022 If the feeling's mutual, then you're a match and can start chatting in our app right away.\r\n\u2022 Not interested? Slide the profile to the left \ud83d\udc48\ud83c\udffe and keep scrolling.\r\n\r\nAdd a self-expression sticker to your profile to give potential matches more insight into who you are.  You can search \ud83e\uddd0 and match \ud83d\ude0d with new people based on shared profile stickers.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udda4 After setting up your profile, you can immediately:\r\n\u2022 Join a community of millions of others like yourself rooting for everything Black!\r\n\u2022 Socially connect with your local Black community\ud83d\udccd\r\n\u2022 Customize who and what they\u2019re looking for\r\n\u2022 Receive a daily personalized group of profiles to look through\r\n\u2022 Chat with other members and build relationships\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udda4 Go Premium, and you can also:\r\n\u2022 Rewind \u23eeon people to give them a second chance, or if you accidentally slid them to the left  \ud83d\ude2c\r\n\u2022 Send over 100 Super Likes \ud83e\udd29 per month to stand out from the crowd and let people know that you're really interested\r\n\u2022 Boost your profile each month to be one of the top profiles in your area for 30 minutes \ud83e\udd47\r\n\u2022 Have an uninterrupted experience with no ads!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udda4 Become Elite, and you can:\r\n\u2022 Get all of the Premium benefits PLUS See Who's Liked You for instant matches!\r\n\r\nEveryone is welcome regardless of gender identity or sexual preference. The LGBTQ+ community has a home on BLK. \ud83c\udf08  Queer dating has a home on BLK.  Meet new people that proudly represent and support you! \u270a\ud83c\udffe    \r\n\r\nSo, what now? Join the community, spread the word, find a match, and have fun!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.blk-app.com/en/privacy-policy Terms & Conditions: https://www.blk-app.com/en/terms-of-use \r\n\r\nIf you choose to purchase a subscription, payment will be charged to your iTunes account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of your subscription. Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase. Current subscription starts at 9.99, and one-month, 3-month, and 6-month packages are available. Prices are in U.S. dollars, may vary in countries other than the U.S. and are subject to change without notice. If you don\u2019t choose to purchase a subscription, you can simply continue to use BLK.",
